# LLM_API_KEY is used as the default source for the API Key:
#   - If LLM_API_KEY is set here, it is used directly at startup (no need to enter it in Settings).
#   - If not set, read from encrypted file / DB, or require first-time entry.
#   - A Key saved in the Settings page always takes precedence over this value and is persisted to config.enc.

#   LLM_API_KEY=sk-xxx
